---
import "../styles/jam.css";
---
<section class="section" id="jam" data-section="Jam">
  <div class="split">
    <div class="split-copy">
      <header class="section-head reveal">
        <p class="label"><span class="badge badge-new">New</span> Jam</p>
        <h2>Same song.<br>Same second.<br><span class="grad-text">No server.</span></h2>
        <p class="muted">Start a Jam, share a link, and your friends' players follow yours, from any network. Peers connect directly over <a href="https://iroh.computer" target="_blank" rel="noopener">iroh</a>. Only the state travels between you; every player streams its own audio from SoundCloud.</p>
      </header>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li class="reveal"><span class="step-n mono">1</span><div><b>Host a Jam.</b> Your player becomes the authority: track, position, play and pause.</div></li>
        <li class="reveal" style="--d:1"><span class="step-n mono">2</span><div><b>Share the link.</b> Friends paste it anywhere in cloudrs to join.</div></li>
        <li class="reveal" style="--d:2"><span class="step-n mono">3</span><div><b>Stay in sync.</b> Clock offset and drift correction keep everyone on the beat.</div></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="ticket reveal">
        <span class="ticket-label mono">invite</span>
        <code class="mono" id="ticket">cloudrs://jam/</code>
        <span class="ticket-note">example</span>
      </div>
      <ul class="facts reveal">
        <li><b class="mono">4–9 ms</b> to connect, direct</li>
        <li><b class="mono">0.000 s</b> idle CPU in 30 s</li>
        <li><b class="mono">~27 B/s</b> per guest</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="jam-stage reveal" style="--d:1">
      <canvas id="jam-canvas" aria-label="Animation: a host sends sync pulses to five guests, all playing in time" role="img"></canvas>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import "../scripts/jam.js";
</script>
